graph TD
    subgraph Bootloader["UEFI Boot Environment"]
        Entry["src/boot/uefi/entry.cpp"]
        GOP["UEFI Graphics Output Protocol (GOP)"]
    end

    subgraph KernelHandoff["Hardware Abstraction Contract"]
        BI["bootinfo.h<br/>BootInfo & Framebuffer"]
    end

    subgraph KernelSpace["SyndromeOS Kernel Space"]
        KMain["kmain.cpp<br/>kernel_main()"]
        PITImpl["pit.cpp<br/>pit_init() & pit_sleep_ms()"]
        PITHeader["pit.h<br/>Port & Frequency Constants"]
        IO["io.h<br/>Inline Assembly Port I/O"]
    end

    subgraph Hardware["Bare-Metal x86_64 Hardware"]
        FB_HW["Linear Video Framebuffer (VRAM)"]
        CPU_PORTS["CPU I/O Bus (IN / OUT Instructions)"]
        PIT_HW["Intel 8254 Timer & Port 0x61 Speaker Control"]
        CPU_STATE["CPU State (HLT Loop)"]
    end

    GOP -->|Populates| BI
    Entry -->|Passes BootInfo*| KMain
    BI -.->|Defines screen layout for| KMain

    KMain -->|Pixel writes base[y*pitch + x]| FB_HW
    KMain -->|asm hlt| CPU_STATE

    PITHeader -.->|Declarations| PITImpl
    IO -->|inb / outb / io_wait| PITImpl

    PITImpl -->|Channel 0 & 2 Port Access| CPU_PORTS
    CPU_PORTS -->|Controls| PIT_HW
